# Breeze True Black: an AMOLED (#000000) variant of Breeze Dark.
# Based on /usr/share/color-schemes/BreezeDark.colors (Plasma 6.7).
#
# Changes:
# - Window, view, header and complementary surfaces are pure black (0,0,0).
# - Raised surfaces use neutral grey steps: 14 (alternate rows),
#   20 (tooltips, alternate backgrounds), 28 (buttons, inactive title bar),
#   the same steps as the browser theme.
# - Breeze Dark's bluish greys (161,169,177 etc.) are replaced with neutral grey.
# - Accent/selection/status colours (links, warnings, errors...) are unchanged
#   from Breeze Dark; the accent colour from System Settings overrides them.
#
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Andrew Lake <jamboarder@gmail.com>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Marco Martin <notmart@gmail.com>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Nate Graham <nate@kde.org>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Noah Davis <noahadvs@gmail.com>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Neal Gompa <ngompa@kde.org>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: David Redondo <kde@david-redondo.de>
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Thomas Duckworth <tduck973564@gmail.com>
# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.0-or-later

